! mcp_bootstrap_p359.strap -- MCP printed page 359: the $DUMP program's
! constants and tables: the panel index word APNLW5, the bit-position
! VFs APT8..A3PT40, AHOTP/AMNTOP/ADMPND, the power-of-two XWs ABDEC,
! 6-bit codes AL48/AL40/AL24, digit masks AKON9/AKON1/AKONZ, the
! floating scale routine ADBLMP/ADLDVD with its power-of-ten table
! AFL10, and the dump's alphabetic literals (AXMAGE .. ATR16), lines
! 1-56.
!
! docs/MCP_Mar63_250-445.pdf PDF p.109, read at 400 dpi, names and
! doubtful glyphs at 900 dpi.  Header, READ: "TIME CLOCK 00054041
! PUNID 22$DUMP  CARD ID VB000791  DIST. OF 3/01  3/01  PAGE NUMBER
! 359"; the heading row's LOCATION field is 236154, line 1's word.
!
! >>> STILL THE $DUMP (PUNID 22$DUMP, card series VB...).  No new
! PUNID, no SLC on the page.  Nothing here is taken from the LOADER
! overlay (pp.320-334).  No TAIL.
!
! THE PAGE.  56 lines; every line number prints a "*".  "*" after the
! LOCATION on lines 13, 26, 40, 55.  Remark on line 29 (-REDUCE X BY
! 10 TO THE N POWER).  Line 45's CNOP prints no location and no binary
! (AXMAGE ends at 236215.60; the half-word fill is too short for a
! NOP).  Located rows contiguous from 236154.00 (line 1) to 236231.00
! (line 56, ATR16, 5 characters = 40 bits; next 236231.50).
!
! JOIN.  p.358 (scratch neighbour) ends with APNLW4 XW at 236153.00, a
! full word: next 236154.00 = line 1.  p.360 (scratch neighbour)
! opens with SLC,(8)236231.50, AMASK (A*)DD at 236231.50 = this page's
! next location: contiguous.
!
! FLOATING DD.  Lines 33-39 ("AFL10 DD(N),1.E1,...,1.E64") and line 43
! ("A1E14 DD(BU,48),1.E14") assemble as printed, bit for bit
! (C28-6129 printed pp.18-19, 27-29; the fraction is truncated, which
! is witnessed by THIS page's lines 38-40 -- see strap_asm's
! _dd_normalized).  Lines 40-42's card ("DD(N),1.E128,1.E512,
! 9.99999E615", one card, VB000817) is NOT handed to the assembler:
! 1.E512 and 9.99999E615 lie outside the floating range C28-6129
! printed p.27 states (10^-308 .. 10^308), both print the same
! exponent 3246+, and no cited rule gives those words.  The card is a
! comment with an SLC to line 43's printed location; words 236211.00-
! 236213.00 are not in the image, and their printed binaries are
! recorded at the end, unchecked.
!
! ENTRY-MODE DATA (alpha, 8-bit bytes; the character after A in "(A8)"
! / "(A*)" is the terminator).  Blanks counted on a 40.07 px/char
! grid at 400 dpi and confirmed at 900 dpi, and every count agrees
! with the next printed location:
!   line 44 AXMAGE: 8 X's (64 bits).
!   line 46 APLC: "-" + 7 blanks; line 47 APXW: 7 blanks + "."; line
!     48 ABLNK: 8 blanks; line 49 APFL: 2 blanks, ".", 5 blanks (each
!     64 bits, 236216.00 .. 236222.00).  Line 46's speck mid-field at
!     900 dpi is far smaller than the periods of lines 47/49 and sits
!     between character cells (3.4 cells past the "-"; the periods sit
!     on cell centres, 7.1 and 2.1): not a character.
!   line 50 ALLCN "ALL CONTAIN" (11 chars, 88 bits -> 236223.30).
!   line 55 AMCMDE "IO, NOT AUTO-STACKING MODE" + 6 blanks (32 chars,
!     256 bits, 236225.00 -> 236231.00), under a printed (BU,8).
!
! GLYPHS SETTLED BY OTHER THAN PLAIN INK:
!   * line 10 "AHCTP": third glyph open; written AHOTP, the spelling of
!     the p.348/p.349 neighbours (who saw it closed, "rounded both
!     sides") at the same 236161 word.  An open glyph says nothing.
!   * line 11 "AMNTCP": written AMNTOP, landed pp.343-344's spelling.
!   * line 12 "ACMPND": the second glyph has a worn straight stem;
!     written ADMPND, landed pp.342-344's spelling at 236162.
!   * line 12 "VF,C": the binary is 000000.00+; an open round is 0.
!   * line 52 "AACC": third glyph rounder than the final C at 900 dpi; written AAOC
!     (landed p.344's spelling, 236223.60); datum "AOC" likewise.
!   * line 25 "(16)C909...": first digit open, binary 0044... = 0x09: 0.
!   * line 27 "(16)0FCF0F...": binary 0074170360741703607417 =
!     0x0F0F0F0F0F0F0F0F: the open C is 0.
!   * lines 47-48 print "DC(BU)" for DD(BU) (worn D).
!   * octal open rounds read 0 ("CCCCCC.00+" = 000000.00+).
!
! EXTERNALS.  ABUFF, APCOL1, AMNMBF are DRZ(N)s on p.358 (scratch, not
! landed); plain SYN stand-ins, the form landed pp.342-345 use, at the
! words p.358 prints (lines 1, 10, 11 assemble as printed either way).
!
! CARD SERIALS.  VB000791 .. VB000831, none skipped.  Shared: lines
! 13-20 all print VB000803 (line 21 is VB000804); lines 33-39 VB000816
! (one DD(N) card), lines 40-42 VB000817.

ABUFF   SYN,    (8)236044.0          ! p.358 line 35 DRZ(N),33 (not landed); XW line 1 ABUFF+16. = 236064.00, word only
APCOL1  SYN,    (8)236105.0          ! p.358 line 36 DRZ(N),17 (not landed); VF line 10 APCOL1.08 = 236105.10, word only
AMNMBF  SYN,    (8)236126.0          ! p.358 line 37 DRZ(N),17 (not landed); VF line 11 AMNMBF.08 = 236126.10, word only

        SLC, (8)236154.00
APNLW5  XW,ABUFF+16.,4                                       ! line  1
APT8    VF,.8                                                ! line  2
APT16   VF,.16                                               ! line  3
APT24   VF,.24                                               ! line  4
APT40   VF,.40                                               ! line  5
APT48   VF,.48                                               ! line  6
A1PT8   VF,1.8                                               ! line  7
A1PT16  VF,1.16                                              ! line  8
A3PT40  VF,3.40                                              ! line  9
AHOTP   VF,APCOL1.08                                         ! line 10  printed "AHCTP"
AMNTOP  VF,AMNMBF.08                                         ! line 11  printed "AMNTCP"
ADMPND  VF,0                                                 ! line 12  printed "ACMPND  VF,C"
ABDEC   XW,1.                                                ! line 13
        XW,2.                                                ! line 14
        XW,4.                                                ! line 15
        XW,8.                                                ! line 16
        XW,16.                                               ! line 17
        XW,32.                                               ! line 18
        XW,64.                                               ! line 19
        XW,128.                                              ! line 20
        XW,512.                                              ! line 21
AL48    (2)DD(BU,6),110000                                   ! line 22
AL40    (2)DD(BU,6),101000                                   ! line 23
AL24    DD(BU,6),(8)30                                       ! line 24
AKON9   DD(BU,64,4),(16)0909090909090909                     ! line 25
AKON1   DD(BU,64,4),(16)0101010101010101                     ! line 26
AKONZ   DD(BU,64),(16)0F0F0F0F0F0F0F0F                       ! line 27  printed "0FCF0F..."
        CNOP                                                 ! line 28
ADBLMP  D*(N),AFL10+8.($3)                                   ! line 29  -REDUCE X BY 10 TO THE N POWER
        NOP                                                  ! line 30
ADLDVD  D/(N),AFL10+8.($3)                                   ! line 31
        NOP                                                  ! line 32
AFL10   DD(N),1.E1,1.E2,1.E4,1.E8,1.E16,1.E32,1.E64             ! lines 33-39  -10 TO THE 2 TO THE N
!       DD(N),1.E128,1.E512,9.99999E615                        ! lines 40-42  NOT ASSEMBLED -- see header
        SLC, (8)236214.00            ! STAND-IN: lines 40-42's three DD(N) words 236211.00-236213.00; line 43 printed at 236214.00
A1E14   DD(BU,48),1.E14                                        ! line 43
AXMAGE  (A*)DD(BU),XXXXXXXX*                                 ! line 44
        CNOP,                                                ! line 45
APLC    (A8)DD(BU),-       8                                 ! line 46
APXW    (A8)DD(BU),       .8                                 ! line 47  printed "DC"
ABLNK   (A8)DD(BU),        8                                 ! line 48  printed "DC"
APFL    (A8)DD(BU),  .     8                                 ! line 49
ALLCN   (A8)DD(BU),ALL CONTAIN8                              ! line 50
ALZC    (A*)DD(BU),LZC*                                      ! line 51
AAOC    (A*)DD(BU),AOC*                                      ! line 52  printed "AACC"
AIND    (A*)DD(BU),IND*                                      ! line 53
        CNOP,                                                ! line 54
AMCMDE  (A*)DD(BU,8),IO, NOT AUTO-STACKING MODE      *       ! line 55
ATR16   (A*)DD(BU),TR-16*                                    ! line 56

